# API Requests for Wiki Agent
## Edit the variables section to match your local setup and models
@host = http://localhost:11434
@model = lfm2.5-thinking:latest

### Generate
POST {{host}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "model": "{{model}}",
  "prompt": "Explícame qué es RAG en 3 puntos",
  "stream": false
}

### List models
GET {{host}}/api/tags
